# direnv: enter the flave devshell automatically when you cd into this repo.
#
# Needs Nix (with flakes) and direnv. nix-direnv is strongly recommended: it
# caches the shell, so re-entry is instant instead of a re-evaluation.
# First time only: `direnv allow`. Full walkthrough: docs/getting-started/with-nix.md
use flake
